  "final_answer": "Here are the Top 5 comedy movies on IMDb, sorted by user rating (highest first), from the advanced title search for feature films in the Comedy genre:\n\n1. **Christmas in the Tropics** (2026) — 1h 28m — **10/10** (15 votes)\n   A content creator returns to Jamaica to save her family's failing spice business, but an unexpected romance with the man holding its future forces her to choose between love and legacy.\n\n2. **Patakka Guddiyan** (2026) — 2h 7m — **10/10** (6 votes)\n   Identical twin sisters Roohi and Mahi have completely opposite personalities. When their contrasting lives collide, a sequence of mistaken identities and misunderstandings creates family chaos.\n\n3. **Baa Baa Black Sheep** (2026) — 2h 15m — **10/10** (1.6K votes)\n   A single misplaced object sets off a wild 24-hour chain reaction, sweeping six strangers into chaotic fun. As it changes hands, petty blunders and comic mix-ups collide, forging unexpected connections that upend all their lives forever.\n\n4. **La Herencia de los Ramírez** (2026) — **10/10** (6 votes)\n   A poor Dominican bus driver is informed that he and all members of the Ramírez family nationwide could be the heirs to a 100-million-dollar inheritance.\n\n5. **Dark plague birds. Funny filming** (2026) — 1h 9m — **10/10** (9 votes)\n   The filming moments of the film Dark plague birds (2026).\n\nA note on the results: sorting purely by user rating surfaces very new 2026 releases with tiny vote counts, so several titles share a perfect 10. If you'd rather see the highest-rated comedies with a meaningful number of votes (e.g. 25,000+ ratings), which gives a list of widely recognized classics instead, just say so and I'll re-run the search with that filter.",
